~ start
Test: [#area=external] Hi welcome to the test dialogue
- 1. Show me the dice roll => roll
- 2. Show me the automatic check => check

~ roll
Test: I've got some options here
- Pop your shoulder \n(Resolve + Brawl) Degree 1 [#check=resolve_brawl_1]
	if PlayerStatsWrapper.Instance.PerformCheck("resolve_brawl_1")
		Test: Holy shit that was really impressive
		Test: Looked like it hurt though, damn
	else
		Test: Are you okay? Your arm is kinda detached from your body
- Make up an excuse \n(Wits + Performance) Degree 2 [#check=wits_performance_2]
	if PlayerStatsWrapper.Instance.PerformCheck("wits_performance_2")
		Test: Hmmm yeah I believe you
	else
		Test: What the fuck did you just say to me?
- Get your life together \n(Composure + Insight) Degree 20 [#check=composure_insight_20]
	if PlayerStatsWrapper.Instance.PerformCheck("composure_insight_20")
		Test: You should not have been able to do that
	else
		Test: Figures
=> END

~ check
